===============================================================================
 This directory consists of several grads scripts for plotting SCM results.
 Because each script is fixed to plot the TOGA COARE data from 20 to 26 Dec 1992, 
 you should modify these scripts to fit the appropriate period and data structure 
 if you want to change the data set.

 Each script produce the plot as follows :

    cnv-heating-rate.gs    convective heating rate (Q1) and moistening rate (Q2)  

    crf-mean.gs            values concerning about cloud radiative forcing 
                           observed CRF values are provided only in case of TOGA data.

    rad-cld.gs             radiative forcing and cloudiness (portrait plot)

    rain.gs                time-series of rainfall
                           total, convective, large-scale rain 
                           time-mean values and correlations are plotted together

    trh-prof.gs            vertical profile of temperature and RH
                           difference fields are plotted, 
                           so you need two experiments for plotting.

    th-prof.gs             same as trh-prof.gs, but for theta_e and theat_es 
